abstract: >-
  An open-source structure-based drug design toolkit for standardized docking
  pose import, OpenMM minimization, structural quality control, protein-ligand
  interaction analysis, ligand conformational strain analysis, and integrated
  design prioritization.
keywords:
  - computational chemistry
  - molecular docking
  - structure-based drug design
  - OpenMM
  - RDKit
  - OpenFF
  - cheminformatics
